Z||000014||Smoooooth GT||06-13-2001||12:49 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ferrari_momo:<BR><B>ummm.. if u were gonna put the exhaust through the middle. you will need MoMo's new trunk cover!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  it is being developed for my 308 cars' trunks.  oh yea, i got the stuff   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  hmm... i like the bumper!  very nice.  gee, i will have to make 355 rear bumper to go with my euro tail light kit now.  but keep up the good work buddy.  meet you one day in person.  i better not park my euro-fiero next to yours.  hehehe<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Momo... What do you think about the exhaust??  middle or behind the door's?? If, I do go middle, then you know me...  I'll get one of those cover's from you.. Glad to see that you got it today. I'm going to banish you from looking at my pic's in progress .. lol at least that way I'll be able to at least beat you in the first show that we are both in...lol Now your going to make a 355 bumper for your light's... I hope that I DON'T like it better then mine...lol<BR>you can park next to me anytime... Steve<BR><P>------------------<BR>aka..FieroSEt <BR>cell.. 903 445 0849  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/new_sig.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000015||Philphine||06-13-2001||10:08 AM||||please, please, please explain this flex agent to me. how's it work? where can you get it? can you tell me the brand name or company that makes it? i've heard of it but whenever i've asked here or anywhere else at best i get vague "yeah, it's made" answer. please. i need it bad. there's at least 2 or 3 projects i could make decisions on and finish if i could find this stuff. <P>pleeeeease!!!||||reg||1
Z||000016||Smoooooth GT||06-13-2001||01:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Philphine:<BR><B>please, please, please explain this flex agent to me. how's it work? where can you get it? can you tell me the brand name or company that makes it? i've heard of it but whenever i've asked here or anywhere else at best i get vague "yeah, it's made" answer. please. i need it bad. there's at least 2 or 3 projects i could make decisions on and finish if i could find this stuff. <P>pleeeeease!!!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>HHhmmm...  Are you stressed or what???  As for you answer regaurding the flex agent, I have a buddy, That has a buddy who own's a body shop, ????? He mixes it up for him and then I get it from him...????? I get it in a unmarked or incorrectly marked can... I'll try to find the exact name for you... As far as I know it's some professional bodyshop stuff???  This stuff work's GREAT, As you can see... My lil' girl(Ciara) who's 5 yrs. old was climbing all up and over the rear bumper and all look's fine this morning!!! I've been letting her abuse the Smooth GT as a test..lol  <BR>Anyhow, I'll do my best to find out this week or weekend for you!!  Steve<P>------------------<BR>Future add's.. 2" drop, 17" wheel's, finish the turbo T-3watercooled,ViperYellow w/blk racin' stripes. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/new_sig.JPG"> ||||reg||1
